# Patterns here are root-anchored, unlike .gitignore: a bare "node_modules"
# would only match one at the context root, not web/node_modules. Without the
# **/ prefix the host's Windows-built modules get copied over the clean
# `npm ci` tree in the builder stage.
**/node_modules
**/.next
api/web
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.git
.gitignore
dl
*.png
*.shortcut
.claude
README.md
